{"code":200,"message":"OK","tweet":{"url":"https://x.com/ring_hyacinth/status/2102986085328716066","id":"2102986085328716066","text":"用 Opus 5.5 制作的小动画。\n\n最近在做的一条中秋节片子，恰逢 Opus 5.5 发布，就在想是不是可以试试做拼贴风的动画。\n\n有点震惊了，效果竟然还不错。\n\n脚本和音乐是我给的；动画由 Opus 5.5 用 JavaScript 代码逐帧画出来，手绘纹理用的是 p5.js + p5.brush，背景底稿和纸张材质由 Nano Banana Pro 生成，音效也是它用 Node.js 程序合成的。\n\n前段时间 GPT 6 做 3D 游戏已经有点吃惊了，原来 LLM 都有做视频和 3D 的潜力，感觉看到了不同技术路径的未来。","raw_text":{"text":"用 Opus 5.5 制作的小动画。\n\n最近在做的一条中秋节片子，恰逢 Opus 5.5 发布，就在想是不是可以试试做拼贴风的动画。\n\n有点震惊了，效果竟然还不错。\n\n脚本和音乐是我给的；动画由 Opus 5.5 用 JavaScript 代码逐帧画出来，手绘纹理用的是 p5.js + p5.brush，背景底稿和纸张材质由 Nano Banana Pro 生成，音效也是它用 Node.js 程序合成的。\n\n前段时间 GPT 6 做 3D 游戏已经有点吃惊了，原来 LLM 都有做视频和 3D 的潜力，感觉看到了不同技术路径的未来。","display_text_range":[0,268],"facets":[{"type":"media","indices":[180,203],"id":"2102985762996379648","display":"pic.x.com/4mbDgHAUEL","original":"https://t.co/4mbDgHAUEL","replacement":"https://x.com/ring_hyacinth/status/2102986085328716066/video/1"}]},"author":{"screen_name":"ring_hyacinth","url":"https://x.com/ring_hyacinth","id":"1515128158835691526","followers":20828,"following":612,"likes":2061,"media_count":311,"name":"Ring Hyacinth","description":"Artist working with @simonxxoo and #AI\n📮ringhyacinth@gmail.com | DM open.","raw_description":{"text":"Artist working with @simonxxoo and #AI\n📮ringhyacinth@gmail.com | DM open.","facets":[]},"location":"","banner_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1515128158835691526/1783313813","avatar_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1811285605252313088/w5sCj3nH_200x200.jpg","joined":"Sat Apr 16 00:41:37 +0000 2022","protected":false,"website":{"url":"http://hyacinth.im","display_url":"hyacinth.im"},"verification":{"verified":true,"verified_at":null,"type":"individual"},"avatar_color":null},"replies":46,"retweets":52,"likes":683,"bookmarks":492,"quotes":20,"created_at":"Thu Sep 24 04:58:48 +0000 2026","created_timestamp":1790225928,"possibly_sensitive":false,"views":54679,"is_note_tweet":true,"community_note":null